OL,3,GNEWSATributes to fallen across North
OL,4,AEast and Cumbria
OL,5,
OL,6,FServicemen, servicewomen and animals
OL,7,Fhave been honoured across the North
OL,8,FEast and Cumbria to mark Remembrance.
OL,10,FMilitary parades and services were held
OL,11,Facross the region for Remembrance
OL,12,FSunday, including at Victory Square in
OL,13,FHartlepool town centre and Carlisle
OL,14,FCathedral.
OL,16,FDurham Cathedral held its Festival of
OL,17,FRemembrance earlier, which saw music
OL,18,Fand a silent poppy drop, and the
OL,19,FMayor's balcony at Barrow Town Hall was
OL,20,Fadorned with about 5,000 knitted and
OL,21,Fcrocheted poppies - created by local
OL,22,Fcrafters.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
