OL,3,GNEWSATributes to fallen across North
OL,4,AEast and Cumbria
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, a tree carving depicting a
OL,7,Fpigeon, dog and horse was unveiled this
OL,8,Fweek at Ridley Park, in Blyth,
OL,9,FNorthumberland, to honour animals who
OL,10,Fdied in conflicts.
